tornado-tabs
============

Vendored copy of the `Tabs` widget from the `ratatui` crate, version
`v0.30.0`.

  Upstream crate:    ratatui
  Upstream repo:     https://github.com/ratatui/ratatui
  Upstream tag:      ratatui-v0.30.0
